   "source": [
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "import sys,json,numpy as np\n",
    "from IPython.display import display,Markdown\n",
    "ROOT=Path.cwd()\n",
    "if not (ROOT/'analysis/compare_all_iq.py').exists(): ROOT=ROOT.parent\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0,str(ROOT/'analysis'))\n",
    "from compare_all_iq import *\n",
    "%matplotlib inline\n",
    "\n",
    "_all=json.loads((OUT/'fit_results.json').read_text())\n",
    "comparison_rows=gallery(_all,['Selected non-EFA','Non-EFA BIFT windows'])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fe4b4d62",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Bayesian indirect Fourier transform for P(r)\n",
    "\n",
    "The forward relation and real-space size are\n",
    "\n",
    "$$I(q)=4\\pi\\int_0^{D_{\\max}}P(r)\\frac{\\sin(qr)}{qr}\\,dr,$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$R_g^2=\\frac{\\int r^2P(r)\\,dr}{2\\int P(r)\\,dr}.$$\n",
    "\n",
    "This cell reruns RAW's actual BIFT implementation. BIFT selects smoothing and Dmax using its Bayesian evidence procedure. The plotted shading is its conditional parameter-sampling uncertainty, not a full systematic uncertainty. q and window sensitivity results are saved separately."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "46f04b2c",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
