  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "96420bf3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## EFA: independent shape patterns across elution\n",
    "\n",
    "We model the background-corrected matrix as $D=SC^T+E$, where S contains component scattering curves and C their elution amplitudes. Divide each q row by its mean error to obtain A, then calculate $A=U\\Sigma V^T$. EFA repeats SVD on progressively longer leading and trailing frame blocks. Component time windows constrain a rotation toward nonnegative elution profiles; mathematical convergence alone does not prove physical separation.\n",
    "\n",
    "The following recomputes the clean-region and shoulder-inclusive SVD tests. It does not force a second species into the clean regions."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "1afe99e1",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-09-21T20:17:33.132147Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-09-21T20:17:33.132101Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-09-21T20:17:33.740625Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-09-21T20:17:33.740234Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "WT_092025 (155, 180) s2 = 13.48 99% rank-one null = 14.79 q/time mode-2 smoothness = 0.39 0.5\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "AA_052026 (163, 204) s2 = 13.86 99% rank-one null = 16.28 q/time mode-2 smoothness = 0.27 0.67\n",
      "WT_092025 (125, 195) s2 = 49.62 99% rank-one null = 19.56 q/time mode-2 smoothness = 0.94 0.96\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "efa_results = []\n",
    "for name,a,b in [('WT_092025',155,180),('AA_052026',163,204),('WT_092025',125,195)]:\n",
    "    r,_ = analyze(name,a,b,simulate=100)\n",
    "    efa_results.append(r)\n",
    "    print(name,(a,b),'s2 =',round(r['sv'][1],2),\n",
    "          '99% rank-one null =',round(r['null_s2_99'],2),\n",
    "          'q/time mode-2 smoothness =',round(r['q_ac'][1],2),round(r['t_ac'][1],2))\n"
   ]
  },
